                                                "sense_id": "d15f33fd-8974-329a-b71f-e2a6cec53c31",
                                                "text": "But it can be recalled that Locsin earlier called out DepEd for seemingly being “unaffected” by the actions of a teacher who body-shamed her by describing her “an obese person” in a Physical Education (PE) educational material after the agency issued an apology."
